    "body": "> But is that use case something you encountered while working on something, or is it a theoretical use case you thought of?\n\nI had this need while developing an app. It's a work in progress about which I can't share specific details. Scoped registries are a new feature so this wasn't load bearing, but I realized it would be really helpful if I could import and use DOM from a template,  since it's an easy and efficient, but not worry about work being done to prepare a registry until ready to use it.",
